### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@question = What is tomorrow's date?

### Baseline — no tools registered
GET {{baseUrl}}/before?message={{question}}

### Naive approach — all 47 tools loaded into every request (~5,141 tokens)
GET {{baseUrl}}/after?message={{question}}

### Tool Search — dynamic tool discovery via vector search (~1,166 tokens)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tool-search?message={{question}}

### Custom question example
GET {{baseUrl}}/tool-search?message=What is the weather like in Paris?